  <diagram id="uc09_unlockuseraccount" name="UC-09 - Unlock User Account">
    <mxGraphModel grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="0" page="0" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject id="mermaid-uc09_unlockuseraccount" label="" mermaidData="{&amp;quot;data&amp;quot;: &amp;quot;%%{init: {\&amp;quot;sequence\&amp;quot;: {\&amp;quot;mirrorActors\&amp;quot;: false}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
actor Admin as \&amp;quot;System Admin\&amp;quot;
participant Page@{ \&amp;quot;type\&amp;quot;: \&amp;quot;boundary\&amp;quot; } as \&amp;quot;User Management Page\&amp;quot;
participant Controller@{ \&amp;quot;type\&amp;quot;: \&amp;quot;control\&amp;quot; } as \&amp;quot;:User Controller\&amp;quot;
participant Service@{ \&amp;quot;type\&amp;quot;: \&amp;quot;control\&amp;quot; } as \&amp;quot;:User Service\&amp;quot;
participant Users as \&amp;quot;:User Account Repository\&amp;quot;
participant Locks as \&amp;quot;:Account Lock Repository\&amp;quot;
participant Audit as \&amp;quot;:Audit Service\&amp;quot;
participant Database@{ \&amp;quot;type\&amp;quot;: \&amp;quot;database\&amp;quot; } as \&amp;quot;:Database\&amp;quot;
Admin-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Page: Confirm Unlock Account for the selected user
activate Page
Page-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Controller: Request account unlock(userId)
activate Controller
Controller-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Controller: Authenticate and recheck current user-administration authority
alt Caller is not authorized - EX-1
Controller--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Page: Deny action without changing account lock
Page--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Admin: Action is not permitted
else Caller is authorized
Controller-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Service: unlockUserAccount(userId, actorId)
activate Service
Service-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Users: findById(userId)
activate Users
Users-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Database: Read selected account within authorized scope
activate Database
Database--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Users: Account / Not found / Read failure
Users--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Service: Account / Not found / Read failure
alt Account does not exist or is outside scope - EX-1
Service--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Controller: Deny action; no account state changed
Controller--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Page: Selected account is unavailable
Page--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Admin: Selected account is unavailable
else Account is inactive - EX-2
Service--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Controller: Do not reactivate account through unlock
Controller--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Page: Reactivation is required before sign-in is eligible
Page--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Admin: Account remains inactive; use Reactivate Account separately
else Read fails - EX-3
Service--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Controller: Unlock could not be completed; no changes
Controller--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Page: Unable to unlock the account
Page--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Admin: Unable to unlock the account; retry is available
else Account is active
Service-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Locks: Read current lock and failed-attempt counter
activate Locks
Locks-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Database: Read current security lock state
Database--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Locks: Locked / Already unlocked / Read failure
Locks--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Service: Current lock state / Read failure
alt Lock cannot be read - EX-3
Service--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Controller: No changes made
Controller--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Page: Unable to unlock the account
Page--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Admin: Unable to unlock the account; retry is available
else Account is already unlocked - ALT-1
Service--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Controller: Current account status; no change
Controller--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Page: Refresh account status
Page--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Admin: Account is already unlocked
else Account is locked
Service-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Locks: Clear lock and reset failed-attempt counter in one transaction
Locks-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Database: Begin transaction; recheck account/lock; stage lock reset
Database--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Locks: Reset staged / State changed / Failure
Locks--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Service: Staged result
Service-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Audit: Stage unlock audit with actor, target and time if reset is valid
activate Audit
Audit-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Database: Stage audit evidence in the same transaction
Database--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Audit: Audit staged / Failure
Audit--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Service: Audit result
Service-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Locks: Commit only if reset and audit succeeded; otherwise rollback
Locks-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Database: Commit all changes or rollback
Database--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Locks: Committed / Already unlocked / Inactive / Failure
Locks--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Service: Final result
alt Reset and audit committed
Service--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Controller: Account unlocked; credentials and active status still required
Controller--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Page: Confirm unlock and refresh displayed account status
Page--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Admin: Account unlocked successfully
else Concurrent unlock - ALT-1
Service--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Controller: Already unlocked; no duplicate change
Controller--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Page: Refresh current status
Page--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Admin: Account is already unlocked
else Account became inactive - EX-2
Service--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Controller: Unlock not applied; account remains inactive
Controller--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Page: Reactivation required
Page--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Admin: Account must be reactivated separately
else Update or audit failed - EX-3
Service--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Controller: Rollback; previous lock state retained
Controller--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Page: Unable to unlock the account
Page--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Admin: Unable to unlock the account; previous lock state retained
end
deactivate Audit
end
deactivate Locks
end
deactivate Service
deactivate Database
deactivate Users
end
deactivate Controller
deactivate Page
&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;config&amp;quot;: null}">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=20;" vertex="1">
