  <diagram id="uc12c_deleterole" name="UC-12c - Delete Role">
    <mxGraphModel grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="0" page="0" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject id="mermaid-uc12c_deleterole" label="" mermaidData="{&amp;quot;data&amp;quot;: &amp;quot;%%{init: {\&amp;quot;sequence\&amp;quot;: {\&amp;quot;mirrorActors\&amp;quot;: false}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
actor Admin as \&amp;quot;System Admin\&amp;quot;
participant RolePage@{ \&amp;quot;type\&amp;quot;: \&amp;quot;boundary\&amp;quot; } as \&amp;quot;Role &amp;amp; Permission Management Page\&amp;quot;
participant RoleController@{ \&amp;quot;type\&amp;quot;: \&amp;quot;control\&amp;quot; } as \&amp;quot;:Role Controller\&amp;quot;
participant RoleService@{ \&amp;quot;type\&amp;quot;: \&amp;quot;control\&amp;quot; } as \&amp;quot;:Role Service\&amp;quot;
participant RoleRepository as \&amp;quot;:Role Repository\&amp;quot;
participant AuditService@{ \&amp;quot;type\&amp;quot;: \&amp;quot;control\&amp;quot; } as \&amp;quot;:Audit Service\&amp;quot;
participant Database@{ \&amp;quot;type\&amp;quot;: \&amp;quot;database\&amp;quot; } as \&amp;quot;:Database\&amp;quot;
Admin-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;RolePage: Select Delete on a role
activate RolePage
RolePage--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Admin: Show delete confirmation dialog
Admin-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;RolePage: Confirm deletion
RolePage-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;RoleController: Delete role
activate RoleController
RoleController-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;RoleService: Delete role
activate RoleService
RoleService-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;RoleRepository: Get role and number of user accounts holding it
activate RoleRepository
RoleRepository-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Database: Retrieve role, its permissions and user count
activate Database
Database--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;RoleRepository: Role, permissions and user count
RoleRepository--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;RoleService: Role, permissions and user count
alt Role not found
RoleService--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;RoleController: Role not found
RoleController--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;RolePage: Role not found
RolePage--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Admin: Show error and refresh role list
else Role is a predefined role
RoleService--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;RoleController: Predefined role cannot be deleted
RoleController--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;RolePage: MSG24 - Predefined role cannot be renamed or deleted
RolePage--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Admin: Show error message
else Role is still held by user accounts
RoleService--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;RoleController: Role is still in use (user count)
RoleController--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;RolePage: MSG25 - Role is still held by n user account(s)
RolePage--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Admin: Show error in confirmation dialog
else Custom role not held by any user account
RoleService-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;RoleRepository: Delete role and its permissions
RoleRepository-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Database: Delete role (role permissions removed together)
Database--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;RoleRepository: Delete result
RoleRepository--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;RoleService: Delete result
alt Role was assigned to a user account in the meantime
RoleService--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;RoleController: Role is still in use (user count)
RoleController--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;RolePage: MSG25 - Role is still held by n user account(s)
RolePage--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Admin: Show error in confirmation dialog
else Role cannot be deleted
RoleService--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;RoleController: Unable to delete role
RoleController--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;RolePage: Error - Unable to delete role
RolePage--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Admin: Show error message
else Role deleted
RoleService-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;AuditService: Record role deletion (name, permissions)
activate AuditService
AuditService-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Database: Save audit log
Database--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;AuditService: Audit log saved
AuditService--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;RoleService: Audit recorded
RoleService--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;RoleController: Role deleted successfully
RoleController--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;RolePage: MSG23 - Role deleted successfully
RolePage--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Admin: Show success message and updated role list
deactivate AuditService
end
end
deactivate Database
deactivate RoleRepository
deactivate RoleService
deactivate RoleController
deactivate RolePage
&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;config&amp;quot;: null}">
