  <diagram id="uc13_viewauditlog" name="UC-13 - View Audit Log">
    <mxGraphModel grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="0" page="0" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject id="mermaid-uc13_viewauditlog" label="" mermaidData="{&amp;quot;data&amp;quot;: &amp;quot;%%{init: {\&amp;quot;sequence\&amp;quot;: {\&amp;quot;mirrorActors\&amp;quot;: false}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
actor Admin as \&amp;quot;System Admin\&amp;quot;
participant Page@{ \&amp;quot;type\&amp;quot;: \&amp;quot;boundary\&amp;quot; } as \&amp;quot;Audit Log Page\&amp;quot;
participant Controller@{ \&amp;quot;type\&amp;quot;: \&amp;quot;control\&amp;quot; } as \&amp;quot;:Audit Log Controller\&amp;quot;
participant Service@{ \&amp;quot;type\&amp;quot;: \&amp;quot;control\&amp;quot; } as \&amp;quot;:Audit Log Query Service\&amp;quot;
participant Repository as \&amp;quot;:Audit Log Repository\&amp;quot;
participant Database@{ \&amp;quot;type\&amp;quot;: \&amp;quot;database\&amp;quot; } as \&amp;quot;:Database\&amp;quot;
Admin-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Page: Request audit entries with selected date range, filters and page
activate Page
Page-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Controller: GET /api/audit-log with query criteria
activate Controller
Controller-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Controller: Authenticate and recheck current audit-view authority
alt Caller is unauthorized
Controller--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Page: Deny request; no audit entries disclosed
Page--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Admin: Audit Log is not accessible
else Caller is authorized
Controller-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Service: getAuditEntries(criteria, caller)
activate Service
Service-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Service: Validate date range, filter values and pagination
alt Invalid criteria - EX-1
Service--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Controller: Identify invalid criteria; query is not applied
Controller--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Page: Filter validation errors
Page--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Admin: Correct the highlighted criteria
else Criteria are valid
Service-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Repository: findReadOnlyPage(criteria, caller)
activate Repository
Repository-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Database: Apply authorized scope and filters before count/pagination;&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;order by OccurredAt descending with stable tie-breaker
activate Database
Database--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Repository: Read-only entries and total / Read failure
deactivate Database
Repository--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Service: Matching page / Read failure
alt Audit entries cannot be loaded - EX-2
Service--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Controller: Load failed
Controller--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Page: Unable to load audit log; offer retry
Page--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Admin: Audit Log unavailable; retry is available
else No entries match - ALT-1
Service--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Controller: Empty page and total zero
Controller--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Page: Empty result preserving selected filters
Page--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Admin: No matching audit entries; filters can be revised
else Entries match
Service--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Controller: Entries with actor, event, target, time, IP and recorded details
Controller--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Page: Requested read-only page
Page--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Admin: Display audit entries in reverse chronological order
end
deactivate Repository
end
deactivate Service
end
deactivate Controller
deactivate Page
&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;config&amp;quot;: null}">
