  <diagram id="uc15_updatemeeting" name="UC-15 - Update Meeting">
    <mxGraphModel grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="0" page="0" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject id="mermaid-uc15_updatemeeting" label="" mermaidData="{&amp;quot;data&amp;quot;: &amp;quot;%%{init: {\&amp;quot;sequence\&amp;quot;: {\&amp;quot;mirrorActors\&amp;quot;: false}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
actor Organizer as \&amp;quot;Meeting Organizer\&amp;quot;
participant MeetingPage@{ \&amp;quot;type\&amp;quot;: \&amp;quot;boundary\&amp;quot; } as \&amp;quot;Meeting Management Page\&amp;quot;
participant MeetingController@{ \&amp;quot;type\&amp;quot;: \&amp;quot;control\&amp;quot; } as \&amp;quot;:Meeting Controller\&amp;quot;
participant MeetingService@{ \&amp;quot;type\&amp;quot;: \&amp;quot;control\&amp;quot; } as \&amp;quot;:Meeting Service\&amp;quot;
participant MeetingRepository as \&amp;quot;:Meeting Repository\&amp;quot;
participant NotificationService@{ \&amp;quot;type\&amp;quot;: \&amp;quot;control\&amp;quot; } as \&amp;quot;:Notification Service\&amp;quot;
participant Database@{ \&amp;quot;type\&amp;quot;: \&amp;quot;database\&amp;quot; } as \&amp;quot;:Database\&amp;quot;
Organizer-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingPage: Submit updated meeting information or reschedule
activate MeetingPage
MeetingPage-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingController: Update meeting or reschedule
activate MeetingController
MeetingController-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingService: Check meeting is owned and editable
activate MeetingService
MeetingService-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingRepository: Find meeting owned by organizer
activate MeetingRepository
MeetingRepository-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Database: Retrieve meeting, status and Actual Start Time
activate Database
Database--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingRepository: Meeting and status
deactivate Database
MeetingRepository--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingService: Meeting and status
deactivate MeetingRepository
MeetingService-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingService: Verify current Organizer authorization (BR-27, BR-158)
alt Meeting not found
MeetingService--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingController: Meeting not found
deactivate MeetingService
MeetingController--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingPage: Return not found
deactivate MeetingController
MeetingPage--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Organizer: Meeting not found
else Organizer is no longer authorized - EX-1
activate MeetingController
activate MeetingService
MeetingService--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingController: Update authorization denied; no changes saved
deactivate MeetingService
MeetingController--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingPage: Return authorization error
deactivate MeetingController
MeetingPage--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Organizer: Display applicable existing authorization error
else Meeting is not Draft, Rejected or Published - EX-1 / EX-2
activate MeetingController
activate MeetingService
MeetingService--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingController: MSG33 - This meeting can no longer be edited
deactivate MeetingService
MeetingController--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingPage: Return edit restriction
deactivate MeetingController
MeetingPage--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Organizer: MSG33 - This meeting can no longer be edited
else Meeting is Published - AF-1
activate MeetingController
activate MeetingService
MeetingService-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingService: Recheck current Organizer permission, Published status and that&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;the Meeting has not started; allow changes only to Planned Start Time,&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;Planned End Time and Location (BR-27, BR-158)
alt Meeting has started or is no longer Published - EX-2
MeetingService--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingController: MSG33 - This meeting can no longer be edited
deactivate MeetingService
MeetingController--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingPage: Return reschedule restriction; schedule unchanged
deactivate MeetingController
MeetingPage--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Organizer: MSG33 - This meeting can no longer be edited
else Reschedule is permitted
activate MeetingController
activate MeetingService
MeetingService-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingService: Validate new start is later than current time&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;and end follows start (BR-62, BR-75)
alt New start is not in the future or a field outside the Reschedule set was modified - EX-2
MeetingService--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingController: MSG31 - Invalid meeting information
deactivate MeetingService
MeetingController--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingPage: Return validation errors; schedule unchanged
deactivate MeetingController
MeetingPage--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Organizer: MSG31 - Invalid meeting information
else End time or required schedule information is invalid - EX-1
activate MeetingController
activate MeetingService
MeetingService--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingController: MSG31 - Invalid meeting information
deactivate MeetingService
MeetingController--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingPage: Return validation errors; schedule unchanged
deactivate MeetingController
MeetingPage--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Organizer: MSG31 - Invalid meeting information
else New schedule is valid
activate MeetingController
activate MeetingService
MeetingService-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingRepository: Save new schedule and record Reschedule history;&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;retain Published status and assigned approver (BR-38, BR-76, BR-158)
activate MeetingRepository
MeetingRepository-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Database: Save schedule and lifecycle history atomically
activate Database
alt Reschedule cannot be saved - EX-3
Database--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingRepository: Save failed; previous schedule, status and history preserved
deactivate Database
MeetingRepository--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingService: Reschedule failed
deactivate MeetingRepository
MeetingService--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingController: MSG36 - Unable to update the meeting.&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;Please try again
deactivate MeetingService
MeetingController--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingPage: Return update failure; no notification sent
deactivate MeetingController
MeetingPage--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Organizer: MSG36 - Unable to update the meeting.&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;Please try again
else New schedule is saved
activate Database
activate MeetingController
activate MeetingRepository
activate MeetingService
Database--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingRepository: Schedule and Reschedule history saved
deactivate Database
MeetingRepository--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingService: Rescheduled Meeting
deactivate MeetingRepository
MeetingService-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationService: Queue schedule-update notifications for affected invitees (BR-76)
activate NotificationService
NotificationService--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingService: Notifications queued / delivery unavailable;&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;delivery failure does not undo the saved change
deactivate NotificationService
MeetingService--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingController: Reschedule successful
deactivate MeetingService
MeetingController--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingPage: MSG138 - Meeting rescheduled successfully. Invitees will be notified.
deactivate MeetingController
MeetingPage--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Organizer: MSG138 - Meeting rescheduled successfully. Invitees will be notified.
end
end
end
else Meeting is Draft or Rejected
activate MeetingController
activate MeetingService
MeetingService--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingController: Meeting is editable
deactivate MeetingService
MeetingController-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingService: Update meeting information
activate MeetingService
MeetingService-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingRepository: Recheck owned meeting for update
activate MeetingRepository
MeetingRepository-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Database: Retrieve current meeting and status
activate Database
Database--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingRepository: Current meeting and status
deactivate Database
MeetingRepository--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingService: Current meeting and status
deactivate MeetingRepository
MeetingService-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingService: Recheck Draft or Rejected status
alt Meeting is no longer editable - EX-1
MeetingService--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingController: MSG33 - This meeting can no longer be edited
deactivate MeetingService
MeetingController--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingPage: Return edit restriction
deactivate MeetingController
MeetingPage--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Organizer: MSG33 - This meeting can no longer be edited
else Meeting remains editable
activate MeetingController
activate MeetingService
MeetingService-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingService: Validate required meeting information and Planned End Time after&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;Planned Start Time (BR-24, BR-27, BR-62)
alt Meeting information is invalid - EX-1
MeetingService--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingController: MSG31 - Invalid meeting information
deactivate MeetingService
MeetingController--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingPage: Return validation errors
deactivate MeetingController
MeetingPage--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Organizer: MSG31 - Invalid meeting information
else Meeting information is valid
activate MeetingController
activate MeetingService
MeetingService-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingRepository: Update meeting information;&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;keep lifecycle status and approval assignment unchanged
activate MeetingRepository
MeetingRepository-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Database: Save meeting information
activate Database
alt Meeting cannot be updated - EX-3
Database--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingRepository: Update failed
deactivate Database
MeetingRepository--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingService: Meeting update failed
deactivate MeetingRepository
MeetingService--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingController: MSG36 - Unable to update the meeting.&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;Please try again
deactivate MeetingService
MeetingController--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingPage: Return meeting update failure
deactivate MeetingController
MeetingPage--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Organizer: MSG36 - Unable to update the meeting.&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;Please try again
else Meeting updated successfully
activate Database
activate MeetingController
activate MeetingRepository
activate MeetingService
Database--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingRepository: Meeting information saved
deactivate Database
MeetingRepository--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingService: Updated meeting
deactivate MeetingRepository
MeetingService--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingController: Meeting updated successfully
deactivate MeetingService
MeetingController--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingPage: MSG30 - Meeting updated successfully
deactivate MeetingController
MeetingPage--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Organizer: MSG30 - Meeting updated successfully
end
end
end
end
deactivate MeetingPage
&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;config&amp;quot;: null}">
