  <diagram id="uc22_endmeeting" name="UC-22 - End Meeting">
    <mxGraphModel grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="0" page="0" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject id="mermaid-uc22_endmeeting" label="" mermaidData="{&amp;quot;data&amp;quot;: &amp;quot;%%{init: {\&amp;quot;sequence\&amp;quot;: {\&amp;quot;mirrorActors\&amp;quot;: false}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
actor Chair as \&amp;quot;Chair\&amp;quot;
participant MeetingPage@{ \&amp;quot;type\&amp;quot;: \&amp;quot;boundary\&amp;quot; } as \&amp;quot;Meeting Management Page\&amp;quot;
participant MeetingController@{ \&amp;quot;type\&amp;quot;: \&amp;quot;control\&amp;quot; } as \&amp;quot;:Meeting Controller\&amp;quot;
participant MeetingService@{ \&amp;quot;type\&amp;quot;: \&amp;quot;control\&amp;quot; } as \&amp;quot;:Meeting Service\&amp;quot;
participant MeetingRepository as \&amp;quot;:Meeting Repository\&amp;quot;
participant MeetingParticipantRepository as \&amp;quot;:Meeting Participant Repository\&amp;quot;
participant AgendaItemRepository as \&amp;quot;:Agenda Item Repository\&amp;quot;
participant MeetingRoom as \&amp;quot;:Online Meeting Room\&amp;quot;
participant Database@{ \&amp;quot;type\&amp;quot;: \&amp;quot;database\&amp;quot; } as \&amp;quot;:Database\&amp;quot;
Chair-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingPage: Confirm End Meeting
activate MeetingPage
MeetingPage-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingController: End Meeting
activate MeetingController
MeetingController-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingService: endMeeting(meetingId, chairId)
activate MeetingService
MeetingService-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingRepository: Get current meeting
activate MeetingRepository
MeetingRepository-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Database: Retrieve meeting and lifecycle status
activate Database
Database--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingRepository: Meeting / Meeting not found
deactivate Database
MeetingRepository--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingService: Meeting / Meeting not found
deactivate MeetingRepository
MeetingService-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingParticipantRepository: Verify current active Chair assignment (BR-130)
activate MeetingParticipantRepository
MeetingParticipantRepository-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Database: Retrieve Chair assignment
activate Database
Database--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingParticipantRepository: Assignment / No assignment
deactivate Database
MeetingParticipantRepository--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingService: Assignment / No assignment
deactivate MeetingParticipantRepository
MeetingService-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingService: Revalidate active Chair and InProgress status (BR-130, BR-132)
alt Meeting or Chair is no longer eligible - EX-1
MeetingService--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingController: MSG114 - This meeting cannot be ended
deactivate MeetingService
MeetingController--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingPage: Return meeting end failure
deactivate MeetingController
MeetingPage--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Chair: MSG114 - This meeting cannot be ended
else Meeting and Chair are eligible
activate MeetingController
activate MeetingService
MeetingService-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;AgendaItemRepository: Get the InProgress Agenda Item, if any (BR-159)
activate AgendaItemRepository
AgendaItemRepository-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Database: Find InProgress Agenda Item of the Meeting
activate Database
Database--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;AgendaItemRepository: Agenda Item / None
deactivate Database
AgendaItemRepository--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingService: Agenda Item / None
deactivate AgendaItemRepository
MeetingService-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingRepository: In one transaction: complete the InProgress Agenda Item&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;(Done, actual end time, duration); keep remaining Pending Items Pending,&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;set Meeting Ended,&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;record Actual End Time and lifecycle history; preserve Vote statuses/ballots;&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;no attendance or Vote-closure check (BR-38, BR-132, BR-159)
activate MeetingRepository
MeetingRepository-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Database: Save Agenda Item, Meeting and history atomically
activate Database
alt Meeting end cannot be completed - EX-2
Database--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingRepository: Save failed, transaction rolled back
deactivate Database
MeetingRepository--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingService: Meeting end failed
deactivate MeetingRepository
MeetingService--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingController: MSG116 - Unable to end the meeting. Please try again
deactivate MeetingService
MeetingController--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingPage: Return meeting end failure
deactivate MeetingController
MeetingPage--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Chair: MSG116 - Unable to end the meeting. Please try again&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;Meeting and Agenda Item keep their previous state
else Meeting status is Ended
activate Database
activate MeetingController
activate MeetingRepository
activate MeetingService
Database--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingRepository: Changes committed
deactivate Database
MeetingRepository--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingService: Meeting ended
deactivate MeetingRepository
MeetingService-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingService: Reject further ballot casting because Meeting is Ended (BR-160);&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;Chair may subsequently close existing Open Votes;&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;Automatically refresh the complete saved Agenda&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;for authorized users viewing this Meeting (BR-73)
MeetingService-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingRoom: Stop accepting joins and disconnect connected users (BR-143)
activate MeetingRoom
MeetingRoom--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingService: Room closed; connected users disconnected
deactivate MeetingRoom
MeetingService--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingController: Meeting ended successfully
deactivate MeetingService
MeetingController--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingPage: MSG111 - Meeting ended successfully
deactivate MeetingController
MeetingPage--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Chair: MSG111 - Meeting ended successfully
end
end
deactivate MeetingPage
