  <diagram id="uc23d_reorderagendaitems" name="UC-23d - Reorder Agenda Items">
    <mxGraphModel grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="0" page="0" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject id="mermaid-uc23d_reorderagendaitems" label="" mermaidData="{&quot;data&quot;: &quot;%%{init: {\&quot;sequence\&quot;: {\&quot;mirrorActors\&quot;: false}}}%%\nsequenceDiagram\nactor Secretary as \&quot;Secretary\&quot;\nparticipant MeetingPage@{ \&quot;type\&quot;: \&quot;boundary\&quot; } as \&quot;Meeting Management Page\&quot;\nparticipant AgendaController@{ \&quot;type\&quot;: \&quot;control\&quot; } as \&quot;:Agenda Controller\&quot;\nparticipant AgendaService@{ \&quot;type\&quot;: \&quot;control\&quot; } as \&quot;:Agenda Service\&quot;\nparticipant MeetingRepository as \&quot;:Meeting Repository\&quot;\nparticipant MeetingParticipantRepository as \&quot;:Meeting Participant Repository\&quot;\nparticipant AgendaItemRepository as \&quot;:Agenda Item Repository\&quot;\nparticipant Database@{ \&quot;type\&quot;: \&quot;database\&quot; } as \&quot;:Database\&quot;\nSecretary-&gt;&gt;MeetingPage: Reorder Agenda Items\nactivate MeetingPage\nMeetingPage-&gt;&gt;AgendaController: Reorder Agenda Items\nactivate AgendaController\nAgendaController-&gt;&gt;AgendaService: reorderAgendaItems(meetingId, secretaryId, orderedPendingItemIds)\nactivate AgendaService\nAgendaService-&gt;&gt;MeetingRepository: Get selected Meeting and current status\nactivate MeetingRepository\nMeetingRepository-&gt;&gt;Database: Get selected Meeting and current status\nactivate Database\nDatabase--&gt;&gt;MeetingRepository: Meeting / Not found\ndeactivate Database\nMeetingRepository--&gt;&gt;AgendaService: Meeting / Not found\ndeactivate MeetingRepository\nAgendaService-&gt;&gt;MeetingParticipantRepository: Check active current Secretary assignment\nactivate MeetingParticipantRepository\nMeetingParticipantRepository-&gt;&gt;Database: Check active current Secretary assignment\nactivate Database\nDatabase--&gt;&gt;MeetingParticipantRepository: Active Secretary / Not eligible\ndeactivate Database\nMeetingParticipantRepository--&gt;&gt;AgendaService: Active Secretary / Not eligible\ndeactivate MeetingParticipantRepository\nAgendaService-&gt;&gt;AgendaService: Verify Secretary and permitted Meeting status (BR-65, BR-74)\nalt Reordering no longer permitted - EX-1\nAgendaService--&gt;&gt;AgendaController: MSG67 - The agenda for this meeting can no longer be modified.\nAgendaController--&gt;&gt;MeetingPage: MSG67 - The agenda for this meeting can no longer be modified.\nMeetingPage--&gt;&gt;Secretary: MSG67 - The agenda for this meeting can no longer be modified.\nelse Reordering permitted\nAgendaService-&gt;&gt;AgendaItemRepository: Get complete latest Meeting Agenda, positions and Item statuses\nactivate AgendaItemRepository\nAgendaItemRepository-&gt;&gt;Database: Get complete latest Meeting Agenda, positions and Item statuses\nactivate Database\nDatabase--&gt;&gt;AgendaItemRepository: Current ordered Agenda\ndeactivate Database\nAgendaItemRepository--&gt;&gt;AgendaService: Current ordered Agenda\ndeactivate AgendaItemRepository\nAgendaService-&gt;&gt;AgendaService: Validate each current Pending Item appears exactly once;&lt;br/&gt;exchange only existing Pending positions; no foreign Items;&lt;br/&gt;keep InProgress/Done positions fixed (BR-64, BR-67, BR-68)\nalt Invalid or outdated Pending order - EX-2\nAgendaService--&gt;&gt;AgendaController: MSG143 - Only Pending agenda items can be reordered within their existing positions.&lt;br/&gt;Refresh the agenda and try again.\nAgendaController--&gt;&gt;MeetingPage: MSG143 - Only Pending agenda items can be reordered within their existing positions.&lt;br/&gt;Refresh the agenda and try again.\nMeetingPage--&gt;&gt;Secretary: MSG143 - Only Pending agenda items can be reordered within their existing positions.&lt;br/&gt;Refresh the agenda and try again.\nelse Pending order valid\nAgendaService-&gt;&gt;AgendaItemRepository: Recheck latest Agenda and save Pending position exchanges together;&lt;br/&gt;retain InProgress/Done positions and all execution data (BR-68)\nactivate AgendaItemRepository\nAgendaItemRepository-&gt;&gt;Database: Recheck latest Agenda and save Pending position exchanges together;&lt;br/&gt;retain InProgress/Done positions and all execution data (BR-68)\nactivate Database\nDatabase--&gt;&gt;AgendaItemRepository: Change saved / Save failed; previous Agenda preserved\ndeactivate Database\nAgendaItemRepository--&gt;&gt;AgendaService: Change saved / Save failed; previous Agenda preserved\ndeactivate AgendaItemRepository\nalt Change cannot be saved - EX-3\nAgendaService--&gt;&gt;AgendaController: MSG71 - Unable to update the agenda order. Please try again.\nAgendaController--&gt;&gt;MeetingPage: MSG71 - Unable to update the agenda order. Please try again.\nMeetingPage--&gt;&gt;Secretary: MSG71 - Unable to update the agenda order. Please try again.\nelse Change saved successfully\nAgendaService-&gt;&gt;AgendaService: Automatically refresh the complete saved Agenda&lt;br/&gt;for currently authorized users viewing this Meeting (BR-73)\nAgendaService--&gt;&gt;AgendaController: MSG63 - Agenda order updated successfully.\nAgendaController--&gt;&gt;MeetingPage: MSG63 - Agenda order updated successfully.\nMeetingPage--&gt;&gt;Secretary: MSG63 - Agenda order updated successfully.\nend\nend\nend\ndeactivate AgendaService\ndeactivate AgendaController\ndeactivate MeetingPage\n&quot;, &quot;config&quot;: null}">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=20;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="3530.0" height="46.0" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
