  <diagram id="uc24_setcurrentagendaitem" name="UC-24 - Set Current Agenda Item">
    <mxGraphModel grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="0" page="0" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject id="mermaid-uc24_setcurrentagendaitem" label="" mermaidData="{&quot;data&quot;: &quot;%%{init: {\&quot;sequence\&quot;: {\&quot;mirrorActors\&quot;: false}}}%%\nsequenceDiagram\nactor Chair as \&quot;Chair\&quot;\nparticipant MeetingPage@{ \&quot;type\&quot;: \&quot;boundary\&quot; } as \&quot;Meeting Management Page\&quot;\nparticipant AgendaController@{ \&quot;type\&quot;: \&quot;control\&quot; } as \&quot;:Agenda Controller\&quot;\nparticipant AgendaService@{ \&quot;type\&quot;: \&quot;control\&quot; } as \&quot;:Agenda Service\&quot;\nparticipant MeetingRepository as \&quot;:Meeting Repository\&quot;\nparticipant MeetingParticipantRepository as \&quot;:Meeting Participant Repository\&quot;\nparticipant AgendaItemRepository as \&quot;:Agenda Item Repository\&quot;\nparticipant Database@{ \&quot;type\&quot;: \&quot;database\&quot; } as \&quot;:Database\&quot;\nChair-&gt;&gt;MeetingPage: Set Current Agenda Item\nactivate MeetingPage\nMeetingPage-&gt;&gt;AgendaController: Set Current Agenda Item\nactivate AgendaController\nAgendaController-&gt;&gt;AgendaService: setCurrentAgendaItem(meetingId, agendaItemId, chairId)\nactivate AgendaService\nAgendaService-&gt;&gt;MeetingRepository: Get selected Meeting and current status\nactivate MeetingRepository\nMeetingRepository-&gt;&gt;Database: Get selected Meeting and current status\nactivate Database\nDatabase--&gt;&gt;MeetingRepository: Meeting / Not found\ndeactivate Database\nMeetingRepository--&gt;&gt;AgendaService: Meeting / Not found\ndeactivate MeetingRepository\nAgendaService-&gt;&gt;MeetingParticipantRepository: Check active current Chair assignment\nactivate MeetingParticipantRepository\nMeetingParticipantRepository-&gt;&gt;Database: Check active current Chair assignment\nactivate Database\nDatabase--&gt;&gt;MeetingParticipantRepository: Active Chair / Not eligible\ndeactivate Database\nMeetingParticipantRepository--&gt;&gt;AgendaService: Active Chair / Not eligible\ndeactivate MeetingParticipantRepository\nAgendaService-&gt;&gt;AgendaItemRepository: Get selected Item and Meeting membership\nactivate AgendaItemRepository\nAgendaItemRepository-&gt;&gt;Database: Get selected Item and Meeting membership\nactivate Database\nDatabase--&gt;&gt;AgendaItemRepository: Item and current status / Not found\ndeactivate Database\nAgendaItemRepository--&gt;&gt;AgendaService: Item and current status / Not found\ndeactivate AgendaItemRepository\nAgendaService-&gt;&gt;AgendaService: Verify active Chair, Meeting InProgress,&lt;br/&gt;Item belongs to selected Meeting and Item is Pending (BR-64, BR-69)\nalt Item cannot become current - EX-1\nAgendaService--&gt;&gt;AgendaController: MSG73 - This agenda item cannot be set as current.\nAgendaController--&gt;&gt;MeetingPage: MSG73 - This agenda item cannot be set as current.\nMeetingPage--&gt;&gt;Chair: MSG73 - This agenda item cannot be set as current.\nelse Initial conditions valid\nAgendaService-&gt;&gt;AgendaItemRepository: Get any InProgress Item and first Pending Item&lt;br/&gt;in latest Meeting order (BR-70, BR-71)\nactivate AgendaItemRepository\nAgendaItemRepository-&gt;&gt;Database: Get any InProgress Item and first Pending Item&lt;br/&gt;in latest Meeting order (BR-70, BR-71)\nactivate Database\nDatabase--&gt;&gt;AgendaItemRepository: Current Item / None; first Pending Item\ndeactivate Database\nAgendaItemRepository--&gt;&gt;AgendaService: Current Item / None; first Pending Item\ndeactivate AgendaItemRepository\nalt Another Item is InProgress - EX-2\nAgendaService--&gt;&gt;AgendaController: MSG72 - Another agenda item is already in progress.&lt;br/&gt;Complete it before starting another agenda item.\nAgendaController--&gt;&gt;MeetingPage: MSG72 - Another agenda item is already in progress.&lt;br/&gt;Complete it before starting another agenda item.\nMeetingPage--&gt;&gt;Chair: MSG72 - Another agenda item is already in progress.&lt;br/&gt;Complete it before starting another agenda item.\nelse Selected Item is not first Pending - EX-3\nAgendaService--&gt;&gt;AgendaController: MSG144 - Start the first Pending agenda item in the current order.&lt;br/&gt;Agenda unchanged; refresh Agenda\nAgendaController--&gt;&gt;MeetingPage: MSG144 - Start the first Pending agenda item in the current order.&lt;br/&gt;Agenda unchanged; refresh Agenda\nMeetingPage--&gt;&gt;Chair: MSG144 - Start the first Pending agenda item in the current order.&lt;br/&gt;Agenda unchanged; refresh Agenda\nelse Selected Item is first Pending and no Item is current\nAgendaService-&gt;&gt;AgendaItemRepository: Recheck current status and order and save InProgress with actual start time&lt;br/&gt;as one successful change; allow only one concurrent start (BR-70, BR-71, BR-72)\nactivate AgendaItemRepository\nAgendaItemRepository-&gt;&gt;Database: Recheck current status and order and save InProgress with actual start time&lt;br/&gt;as one successful change; allow only one concurrent start (BR-70, BR-71, BR-72)\nactivate Database\nDatabase--&gt;&gt;AgendaItemRepository: Started / Another Item started / First Pending changed / Save failed\ndeactivate Database\nAgendaItemRepository--&gt;&gt;AgendaService: Started / Another Item started / First Pending changed / Save failed\ndeactivate AgendaItemRepository\nalt Another Item became current - EX-2\nAgendaService--&gt;&gt;AgendaController: MSG72 - Another agenda item is already in progress.&lt;br/&gt;Complete it before starting another agenda item.\nAgendaController--&gt;&gt;MeetingPage: MSG72 - Another agenda item is already in progress.&lt;br/&gt;Complete it before starting another agenda item.\nMeetingPage--&gt;&gt;Chair: MSG72 - Another agenda item is already in progress.&lt;br/&gt;Complete it before starting another agenda item.\nelse First Pending changed - EX-3\nAgendaService--&gt;&gt;AgendaController: MSG144 - Start the first Pending agenda item in the current order.\nAgendaController--&gt;&gt;MeetingPage: MSG144 - Start the first Pending agenda item in the current order.\nMeetingPage--&gt;&gt;Chair: MSG144 - Start the first Pending agenda item in the current order.\nelse Status or actual start cannot be saved - EX-4\nAgendaService--&gt;&gt;AgendaController: MSG75 - Unable to set the current agenda item. Please try again.&lt;br/&gt;Previous Agenda and timestamps preserved\nAgendaController--&gt;&gt;MeetingPage: MSG75 - Unable to set the current agenda item. Please try again.&lt;br/&gt;Previous Agenda and timestamps preserved\nMeetingPage--&gt;&gt;Chair: MSG75 - Unable to set the current agenda item. Please try again.&lt;br/&gt;Previous Agenda and timestamps preserved\nelse Item started successfully\nAgendaService-&gt;&gt;AgendaService: Automatically refresh the complete Agenda&lt;br/&gt;for currently authorized viewers (BR-73)\nAgendaService--&gt;&gt;AgendaController: MSG64 - Current agenda item updated successfully.\nAgendaController--&gt;&gt;MeetingPage: MSG64 - Current agenda item updated successfully.\nMeetingPage--&gt;&gt;Chair: MSG64 - Current agenda item updated successfully.\nend\nend\nend\ndeactivate AgendaService\ndeactivate AgendaController\ndeactivate MeetingPage\n&quot;, &quot;config&quot;: null}">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=20;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="3184.0" height="46.0" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
