  <diagram id="uc28c_removemeetingparticipant" name="UC-28c - Remove Meeting Participant">
    <mxGraphModel grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="0" page="0" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject id="mermaid-uc28c_removemeetingparticipant" label="" mermaidData="{&quot;data&quot;: &quot;%%{init: {\&quot;sequence\&quot;: {\&quot;mirrorActors\&quot;: false}}}%%\nsequenceDiagram\nactor User as \&quot;Secretary\&quot;\nparticipant MeetingPage@{ \&quot;type\&quot;: \&quot;boundary\&quot; } as \&quot;Meeting Management Page\&quot;\nparticipant ParticipantController@{ \&quot;type\&quot;: \&quot;control\&quot; } as \&quot;:Meeting Participant Controller\&quot;\nparticipant ParticipantService@{ \&quot;type\&quot;: \&quot;control\&quot; } as \&quot;:Meeting Participant Service\&quot;\nparticipant ParticipantRepository as \&quot;:Meeting Participant Repository\&quot;\nparticipant Database@{ \&quot;type\&quot;: \&quot;database\&quot; } as \&quot;:Database\&quot;\nparticipant NotificationService as \&quot;:Notification Service\&quot;\nUser-&gt;&gt;MeetingPage: Confirm removal of an internal participant or revocation of a Guest invitation\nactivate MeetingPage\nMeetingPage-&gt;&gt;ParticipantController: Confirm removal of an internal participant or revocation of a Guest invitation\nactivate ParticipantController\nParticipantController-&gt;&gt;ParticipantService: removeMeetingParticipant(meeting, secretary, selectedPerson)\nactivate ParticipantService\nParticipantService-&gt;&gt;ParticipantRepository: Read Meeting status, current internal and Guest roster,&lt;br/&gt;actor relationship, roles and additional permissions\nactivate ParticipantRepository\nParticipantRepository-&gt;&gt;Database: Retrieve current Meeting and roster information\nactivate Database\nDatabase--&gt;&gt;ParticipantRepository: Current information / Read failure\ndeactivate Database\nParticipantRepository--&gt;&gt;ParticipantService: Current information / Read failure\ndeactivate ParticipantRepository\nParticipantService-&gt;&gt;ParticipantService: Verify current Secretary, editable Meeting status, current selected person&lt;br/&gt;Published/InProgress retain a Secretary; preparation may temporarily have none;&lt;br/&gt;Organizer may recover the missing Secretary; protect current Chair in Published/InProgress (BR-79, BR-80, BR-122, BR-126)\nalt Secretary or selected person is no longer current - EX-1\nParticipantService--&gt;&gt;ParticipantController: Request denied; participation and access unchanged\nParticipantController--&gt;&gt;MeetingPage: Request denied; participation and access unchanged\nMeetingPage--&gt;&gt;User: Request denied; participation and access unchanged\nelse Published/InProgress required role would be removed - EX-1\nParticipantService--&gt;&gt;ParticipantController: MSG109 - The meeting must retain its required Chair and Secretary. Assign a replacement first.\nParticipantController--&gt;&gt;MeetingPage: MSG109 - The meeting must retain its required Chair and Secretary. Assign a replacement first.\nMeetingPage--&gt;&gt;User: MSG109 - The meeting must retain its required Chair and Secretary. Assign a replacement first.\nelse Meeting status disallows changes - EX-1\nParticipantService--&gt;&gt;ParticipantController: MSG98 - The meeting participant list cannot be modified in its current status.\nParticipantController--&gt;&gt;MeetingPage: MSG98 - The meeting participant list cannot be modified in its current status.\nMeetingPage--&gt;&gt;User: MSG98 - The meeting participant list cannot be modified in its current status.\nelse Removal is permitted\nParticipantService-&gt;&gt;ParticipantRepository: Remove internal assignment or revoke Guest invitation;&lt;br/&gt;end assignment-specific access and extras, retain response/attendance/comment/ballot history (BR-97, BR-100–BR-103, BR-157, BR-177)\nactivate ParticipantRepository\nParticipantRepository-&gt;&gt;Database: Save all requested changes together;&lt;br/&gt;recheck Meeting status, authority and roster before saving\nactivate Database\nDatabase--&gt;&gt;ParticipantRepository: Complete save / No changes saved\ndeactivate Database\nParticipantRepository--&gt;&gt;ParticipantService: Complete save / No changes saved\ndeactivate ParticipantRepository\nalt Save fails - EX-2\nParticipantService--&gt;&gt;ParticipantController: MSG104 - Unable to remove the meeting participant. Please try again.\nParticipantController--&gt;&gt;MeetingPage: MSG104 - Unable to remove the meeting participant. Please try again.\nMeetingPage--&gt;&gt;User: MSG104 - Unable to remove the meeting participant. Please try again.\nelse Removal saved\nParticipantService-&gt;&gt;ParticipantService: Re-evaluate room access; disconnect only if no independent valid relationship remains (BR-101)\nopt Meeting is Published or InProgress\nParticipantService-&gt;&gt;NotificationService: Arrange notices to every affected invitee;&lt;br/&gt;Guest delivery is email only; no protected access link (BR-93–BR-95)\nactivate NotificationService\nNotificationService--&gt;&gt;ParticipantService: Delivery arranged / Failure recorded for retry\ndeactivate NotificationService\nend\nParticipantService--&gt;&gt;ParticipantController: MSG103 - Meeting participant removed successfully.\nParticipantController--&gt;&gt;MeetingPage: MSG103 - Meeting participant removed successfully.\nMeetingPage--&gt;&gt;User: MSG103 - Meeting participant removed successfully.\nend\nend\ndeactivate ParticipantService\ndeactivate ParticipantController\ndeactivate MeetingPage\n&quot;, &quot;config&quot;: null}">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=20;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="4057.0" height="46.0" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
