  <diagram id="uc67b_markallnotificationsasread" name="UC-67b - Mark All Notifications as Read">
    <mxGraphModel grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="0" page="0" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject id="mermaid-uc67b_markallnotificationsasread" label="" mermaidData="{&amp;quot;data&amp;quot;: &amp;quot;%%{init: {\&amp;quot;sequence\&amp;quot;: {\&amp;quot;mirrorActors\&amp;quot;: false}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
actor User as \&amp;quot;Meeting Organizer / Meeting Approver / System Admin / Chair / Secretary / Participant\&amp;quot;
participant NotificationPanel@{ \&amp;quot;type\&amp;quot;: \&amp;quot;boundary\&amp;quot; } as \&amp;quot;Notification Panel\&amp;quot;
participant NotificationController@{ \&amp;quot;type\&amp;quot;: \&amp;quot;control\&amp;quot; } as \&amp;quot;:Notification Controller\&amp;quot;
participant NotificationService@{ \&amp;quot;type\&amp;quot;: \&amp;quot;control\&amp;quot; } as \&amp;quot;:Notification Service\&amp;quot;
participant NotificationRepository as \&amp;quot;:Notification Repository\&amp;quot;
participant Database@{ \&amp;quot;type\&amp;quot;: \&amp;quot;database\&amp;quot; } as \&amp;quot;:Database\&amp;quot;
User-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationPanel: Select \&amp;quot;Mark All as Read\&amp;quot;
activate NotificationPanel
NotificationPanel-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationController: Mark all notifications as read
activate NotificationController
NotificationController-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationService: Mark all unread notifications as read
activate NotificationService
NotificationService-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationRepository: Mark all unread notifications&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;for current user as read (BR-47, BR-51)
activate NotificationRepository
NotificationRepository-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Database: Update all unread notifications&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;belonging to current user
activate Database
alt No unread notifications - AF-1
Database--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationRepository: No unread notifications found
NotificationRepository--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationService: No unread notifications
NotificationService--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationController: No changes required
NotificationController--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationPanel: Display current notification list&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;with unread count = 0
NotificationPanel--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;User: Show current notifications&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;and zero unread count
else Notifications cannot be updated - EX-1
Database--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationRepository: Update failed
NotificationRepository--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationService: Notifications remain unchanged
NotificationService--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationController: Unable to update notifications
NotificationController--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationPanel: Unable to mark all notifications as read.&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;Please try again.
NotificationPanel--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;User: Display current read statuses&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;and unread count
else Notifications updated successfully
Database--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationRepository: Notifications marked as read
NotificationRepository--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationService: Update completed
NotificationService-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationRepository: Get latest notifications&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;and unread count
NotificationRepository-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Database: Retrieve notification states&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;and unread count
Database--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationRepository: Notifications and unread count
NotificationRepository--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationService: Latest notification state
NotificationService--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationController: Notifications updated successfully
NotificationController--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationPanel: Refresh notification list&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;and unread badge
NotificationPanel--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;User: Display updated statuses&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;and unread count
end
deactivate Database
deactivate NotificationRepository
deactivate NotificationService
deactivate NotificationController
deactivate NotificationPanel
&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;config&amp;quot;: null}">
